# Seasoned Consultant: "Whenever you attack with three or more creatures" counts all of Bot1's attackers, not the Consultant: the
# Consultant stays home and Bot1 attacks with Memnite, Ornithopter and Phyrexian Walker (three), so its trigger resolves once and
# the unattacking Consultant is 3/3 (it gets the pump though it is not attacking). Combat damage: 1 + 0 + 0 = 1, Bot2 20 to 19.
# One trigger for the attack: the power is 3, not 5.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Seasoned Consultant
Memnite
Ornithopter
Phyrexian Walker
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Phyrexian Walker.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Seasoned Consultant.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Memnite > Bot2; Ornithopter > Bot2; Phyrexian Walker > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Seasoned Consultant.Power = 3
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 19
Bot1.Battlefield.Seasoned Consultant.Power = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Seasoned Consultant.Tapped = false
